One problem with your patch. It only selects one monster type as an 
enemy and as an ally.

This means that you might get gnomes as your enemy and gnome lords as 
your ally.

I think that it should work so that if gnomes are selected as enemy then 
both gnome wizards and gnome lords are also enemy or if gnomes are an 
ally then those other two are also allies.

This doesn't extend to others races as easily. Should Uruk-Hai be an 
enemy if mordor orcs are? Green- vs. gray elves. etc. What to do with 
orc captains? Half of them are treated as Uruk-Hai and half as mordor orcs.

You see what I mean?

On coding practise: You should surround your changes with #ifdef #endif 
